---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Support | KiTech Software"
  description="Contact KiTech Software for product support, account assistance, privacy requests, safety concerns, and security reports."
  canonicalPath="/support/"
>
  <main id="main-content" class="info-page" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Support</p>
      <h1>How can we help?</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Contact KiTech Software for product support, account access, privacy requests, safety concerns, or technical problems.
      </p>

      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Product support</h2>
        <div class="product-links">
          <a href="/products/secdoma/support/">
            <strong>SecDoma</strong>
            <span>Cloud, organisation-managed, and self-hosted communication support.</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/products/bantay-mail/support/">
            <strong>Bantay Mail</strong>
            <span>Deployment, mailbox, authentication, and administration support.</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Contact support</h2>
        <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@kitechsoftware.com">hello@kitechsoftware.com</a>.</p>
        <p>Include the product name, platform, application version, a description of the problem, and any non-sensitive error details that may help us investigate.</p>
        <p>Do not send passwords, recovery codes, private keys, payment-card details, or unnecessary personal information.</p>
      </section>

      <div class="card-grid">
        <article class="card">
          <h2>Account deletion</h2>
          <p>Request deletion of an account and associated personal information.</p>
          <a href="/support/delete-account/">Deletion instructions <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h2>Privacy choices</h2>
          <p>Exercise privacy rights or ask how your information is handled.</p>
          <a href="/privacy/choices/">Privacy request options <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h2>Security</h2>
          <p>Report a suspected vulnerability through the responsible-disclosure process.</p>
          <a href="/security/">Security information <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h2>Safety and abuse</h2>
          <p>Report harmful content, abuse, community violations, or a child-safety concern.</p>
          <a href="/legal/community-guidelines/">Reporting guidance <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Postal contact</h2>
        <address>
          KITECH SOFTWARE LTD<br />
          Unit 82a James Carter Road<br />
          Mildenhall<br />
          Bury St. Edmunds<br />
          England<br />
          IP28 7DE
        </address>
        <p>Company number: 10528257.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .info-page { min-height: 70vh; padding: 88px 0 112px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--surface-grad-a), var(--surface)); }
  .narrow { max-width: 920px; }
  h1 { max-width: 760px; font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem); }
  .lead { max-width: 760px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.18rem; }
  .panel, .card { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--card-bg); }
  .panel { margin-top: 32px; padding: 32px; }
  .panel h2, .card h2 { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .product-links { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
  .product-links a { display: grid; gap: 6px; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; color: var(--accent-secondary); text-decoration: none; }
  .product-links a:hover, .product-links a:focus-visible { border-color: var(--accent-secondary); }
  .product-links span { color: var(--muted); }
  .card-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 20px; }
  .card { display: flex; min-height: 220px; flex-direction: column; padding: 28px; }
  .card p { color: var(--muted); }
  .card a { margin-top: auto; color: var(--accent-secondary); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  address { font-style: normal; line-height: 1.7; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .info-page { padding: 68px 0 88px; } .card-grid, .product-links { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
